<description>&lt;p&gt;ISIL suicide bombers struck security facilities in Hasakah, killing two Syrian security force members, and in Tartous, where a gunman was killed after wounding a security officer. The Syrian government is debating a law to grant nationality to children of foreign fighters, reflecting concerns about the legacy of extremist participation. Qatar, Saudi Arabia and Jordan issued condemnations of the attacks on Syrian security facilities, while Syrian authorities seized Iranian weapons destined for Lebanon, a shipment linked to the IRGC. The UCDP recorded 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE9zZWhzX3JnN0lod3RuWVhhSzZqRlZ5U2ttWEl2b0UtSzV0QVNjWGMzMVFsbzEtOTFYQjdxNG1EVmpvRVFRNDk1TlEtOEw0S0R4ZU1IMGZ0ck15MU55c1ZqakFvazFJdTlZSURpdmNUWnlwemFVY3BIMkpweXh3WnM?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOeTd4b2lBcVEtUDcyRnYzMlFrSU1RRHgxY01ZX29QeVplRk14ZFdEWlJQdXVKUVY4emd1azNfdmJwR1dFVy1lcDd3eFJrbU01OE02eHhoaWJCckl0UnFZZUFwX2VyeWl6d2JQeHR3TkJFMnQtSm1zN20wbXJNdThDR1FIQWkzMUZyV2hJVUMtUVBtZ3h4OGlTNGNTNUFXeGtmemdPWlJfRHRfamt2MmpKb2JQdGprOUZ0ZlZGNjhyZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOQ2VxeXdFaS1lMFFkSld5TDNaZXFEMGROX2NkYnFDMkNyVnNhTllwc0NQb3NLNGhwOXFabFI3NTlxU2QtcVBkc2hOTVRJWW5ENGN1Sy12YlZ1YjJDLU94NWNOVkkzMjFKTUs1Q19xREp2azI2ODljbWNTS3dYNHozNTJsQzJqaUFCOXJoQnNnQ0M3TmYxOEt0ZDNHdU1LSlhRQmNKWHVfRG5KQ05tZ1hFcjYyTzY2dnV4M1d4ajkzYmg3VzRy?oc=5&quot;&gt;Saudi Gazette&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxQZ0Zia0ljeWNiVUNnVTB